| Multi: several decoders open at once, as an editor with several clips
| open: 1, 2, 3, 4 and 6 decoders on the hd clip, then 4 and 8 on the small
| one. Every decoder decodes the whole clip, every picture checked. Shows how
| many fit in the VideoCore's memory, what each costs, and how fast they go
| together. Reports to ResultMulti. Run it after a restart.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 1 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 2 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 3 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 6 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -M 8 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultMulti <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.sig
